  "counterfeit_notes": "No NJM2068-specific fakes found. Marketplace 'NJM2068M SOP8 JRC2068' lots carry general remark risk; buy from Mouser, DigiKey or Akizuki. 'DD'/'MD' only means noise-selected, so doubt big premiums. Genuine DMP8 is 5.3 mm wide, not 3.9 mm SOIC.",
  "alternatives": [
    "NJM4580 (similar noise, slightly better THD)",
    "NJM2114 (faster 'higher-performance 2068')",
    "NJM5532 / NE5532",
    "LM4562 / LME49720 (lower distortion, more drive)",
    "OPA1612 / OPA1656",
    "MUSES8820",
    "NJM8068 (newer SOP8, e.g. NJM8068G-TE2)"
  ],
